legal:
This product poses a chemical risk because it contains Chromium VI which exceed the maximum allowed level:
Colour for cheeks – mixture: 13.7 mg/kg;
Colour for cheeks – red-pink: 33.2 mg/kg;
Colour for cheeks – 1.degree of brown: 7.79 mg/kg;
Colour for cheeks -  2.degree of brown: 17.1 mg/kg;

The product does not comply with the Cosmetic Products Regulation.

